#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:2 ae761010754a48a7bb1e45911a78d453
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:4 cb1cb3b3c28540ee9b53d2d1dc992b4d
msgid ""
"In-depth, topic-oriented guides covering TensorMesh's core concepts, design "
"choices, and how to wield each component."
msgstr "面向主题的深入指南，涵盖 TensorMesh 的核心概念、设计取舍，以及如何运用每一个组件。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:10 170dd8da148e4610b8389fdd40c5b371
msgid "Concepts"
msgstr "核心概念"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:14 ca72092bda114bd291ad1cc3ed088d85
msgid ""
"What TensorMesh is, the FEM pipeline, and how the modules fit together."
msgstr "TensorMesh 是什么、有限元方法流水线，以及各模块如何协同工作。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:16 1420bc0c130c4d1e967b037139b1a96b
msgid "Meshes"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:20 64b466bfd8bd4236905965b5fd5dcc39
msgid "Build, inspect, and load/save meshes; per-node and per-cell data."
msgstr "构建、检查与加载/保存网格；逐节点与逐单元数据。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:22 98865142d5274f02bf3d089ea98de507
msgid "Elements & Quadrature"
msgstr "单元与求积"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:26 aaebbc79f8204fc4afd639b4870e7718
msgid ""
"The element zoo, basis functions, quadrature rules, and ordering "
"conventions."
msgstr "单元家族、基函数、求积规则以及排序约定。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:28 9df9894af35a4b04a175a7a7e48fbfc6
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "弱形式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:32 4d1b39df6fb04f0493f7fa319a3eab2b
msgid "Write weak forms in pure Python via the three assembler base classes."
msgstr "通过三个装配器基类，用纯 Python 编写弱形式。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:34 3b2816f97f3e405bb1b9880700a908f4
msgid "Mixed Assembly"
msgstr "混合装配"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:38 e23aabc4e05e48ce923f6fe28dcea003
msgid ""
"Multi-field block systems — Taylor-Hood Stokes, generalized order pairs, "
"coupled physics."
msgstr "多场块系统 —— Taylor-Hood Stokes、广义阶次配对、耦合物理。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:40 3bebd9b24b7442fe8fbcf3aad16a9e77
msgid "Boundary Conditions"
msgstr "边界条件"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:44 5c5f764cc9bf4e19b48a04d9efba2989
msgid "Apply Dirichlet BCs via static condensation; handle Neumann naturally."
msgstr "通过静态凝聚施加狄利克雷边界条件；自然地处理诺伊曼边界条件。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:46 e6021f0f9fcb4d58b39af5c94a92bd29
msgid "Sparse Solvers"
msgstr "稀疏求解器"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:50 49f89ad60fbb40c5b39aacec887c0837
msgid ""
"Linear and nonlinear sparse solves via torch-sla — five backends, batched "
"RHS, Newton / Picard / Anderson."
msgstr ""
"通过 torch-sla 进行线性与非线性稀疏求解——五种后端、batch 右端项，以及 Newton / Picard / Anderson 方法。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:52 34706d511cd54025a15248eed3db3841
msgid "Time Integration"
msgstr "时间积分"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:56 6039887ede1d4306b54d08183b36a9fb
msgid ""
"Explicit and implicit-linear Runge-Kutta schemes for transient problems."
msgstr "用于瞬态问题的显式与隐式线性龙格-库塔格式。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:58 dca48f7f588d4a97a3e567c2c65d2965
msgid "Batched Workflows"
msgstr "批量化工作流"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:62 e71f00a6d0df440a8e389392f48993b4
msgid "Three axes of batching: memory chunking, batched RHS, and ML datasets."
msgstr "批量化的三个维度：内存分块、batch 右端项，以及机器学习数据集。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:64 340c65106a67434fb7ac53b867217adc
msgid "Differentiability"
msgstr "可微性"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:68 e3a3bea87b4d4f0e9c14ca532fefd68f
msgid ""
"End-to-end gradients through assemble → solve, for inverse problems and "
"topology opt."
msgstr "贯穿 assemble → solve 的端到端梯度，用于反问题与拓扑优化。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:70 fcd4cb1eb8644f4db19c0f2ea407acfd
msgid "Distributed FEM"
msgstr "分布式有限元方法"

#: ../../source/user_guide/index.rst:74 27733e301ae04c0c8488b20a79c06f6a
msgid ""
"Partition the mesh, assemble per GPU, and solve one system across devices "
"via torch-sla."
msgstr "划分网格，逐 GPU 装配，并通过 torch-sla 跨设备求解统一系统。"
